      "statement": "The tools/hx-smoke-runner/ package is a validation layer that runs known-answer smoke tests against a SUT, records proof, and promotes reviewed evidence; it deliberately does not deploy applications, define server roles, change network architecture, create permanent integration, infer dependencies not declared in the roadmap, or auto-commit evidence.",
